Hi {!Contact.FirstName}

As discussed, please click below to join the Qantas Business Rewards (QBR) program for free, a saving of $89.50.

https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/join.html?code=PFFREIGHT


Spend $600 using your Qantas Freight account between 1 February and 30 April 2020 to be eligible for a one off bonus of 5,000 QBR points.


Please note once you register an email will be sent to you to confirm your details.  Your registration is not complete until you click on the link to activate your membership.


For more information on the QBR program please see https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html.


Please feel free to contact me on the below details should you require assistance with sales related enquiries.



Thank you


Kind regards,

{!User.Name}

{!User.Title}

Qantas Freight

A: {!User.Address}

P: {!User.Phone}

E: {!User.Email}

